graph TD
    A[Sales Order] --> B[Validate Sales Order]
    B -->|Invalid| ERR1[Return Error]
    B -->|Valid| C[Calculate Totals]
    C -->|Error| ERR2[Return Error]
    C -->|Success| D[Create Invoice]
    D -->|Error| ERR3[Return Error]
    D -->|Success| E[Post to Ledger]
    E -->|Error| R1[Rollback Invoice]
    E -->|Success| F[Send Notification]
    F -->|Error| W1[Log Warning]
    F -->|Success| DONE[Invoice Complete]

    style ERR1 fill:#f96
    style ERR2 fill:#f96
    style ERR3 fill:#f96
    style R1 fill:#f96
    style W1 fill:#ff9
    style DONE fill:#9f9
